tforms.\n\nScreenshot that shows an example, from Fairphone 6 - flicker can be seen in the highlighted yellow areas, as well as on the red/main player ship, and in the bottom-most area with the button grid:\n<img width=\"1116\" height=\"2337\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1e5746c9-841f-4d9b-b09a-73b85e33f19e\" />\n\nVideo that shows it, from Nothing Phone (3a):\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e8dc598-ca02-452b-b06e-88906579768a\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nN/A, only have bug reports from users\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A, only have bug reports from users","closed_by":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123370/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123370/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}